(d) matters in respect of which register is to be maintained by the Authority [under sub-clause

(vii) of clause (b)] of sub-section (1) of section 11;

(e) levy of fee and lay down such other requirements on fulfilment of which a copy of register

may be obtained [under sub-clause (viii) of clause (b)] of sub-section (1) of section 11;
